<script src="/jscCommon.js"></script><p><P align=center><FONT face="Monotype Corsiva"><FONT size=4><U><STRONG><FONT size=+0><FONT size=6><FONT face="Lucida Handwriting">Divine Fine Wines</FONT><BR></FONT></FONT></STRONG></U><EM><FONT face="Times New Roman"><FONT size=3>'Distinguished Wines for Discerning People'</FONT></FONT></EM></FONT></FONT></P><STRONG><FONT color=#004080 size=4 face="Monotype Corsiva"><STRONG><FONT color=#004080 size=4 face="Monotype Corsiva"></FONT></STRONG>
<TABLE border=1 cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=650 height=598>
<TBODY>
<TR vAlign=center>
<TD>
<P style="margin-right: 0px">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</P>
<P style="margin-right: 0px"><STRONG><FONT size=2>&nbsp;&nbsp;</FONT></STRONG></P>
<P style="margin-right: 0px"><FONT size=2><STRONG>An Independent Wine Merchant serving Trade; Corporate and&nbsp; Retail customers. Specialising in extra-ordinary, iconic&nbsp;and cult wines, we offer:-</STRONG></FONT></P>
<UL>
<LI>
<DIV style="margin-right: 0px"><FONT size=+0><FONT size=2><STRONG>Interesting,&nbsp;quality wines</STRONG>&nbsp;from&nbsp;the most exclusive &amp; sought-after&nbsp;producers</FONT></FONT></DIV></LI>
<LI>
<DIV style="margin-right: 0px">
<DIV style="margin-right: 0px"><FONT size=2>Top names from&nbsp;<STRONG>Bordeaux</STRONG> &amp; <STRONG>Champagne </STRONG></FONT></DIV></DIV></LI>
<LI>
<DIV style="margin-right: 0px">
<DIV style="margin-right: 0px"><FONT size=2>An&nbsp;evolving range with <STRONG>Best&nbsp;Decile Pricing</STRONG></FONT></DIV></DIV></LI>
<LI>
<DIV style="margin-right: 0px"><FONT size=2><STRONG>Min Order for Nationwide Delivery</STRONG> 1&nbsp;Case (Mixed) or £100</FONT></DIV></LI>
<LI>
<DIV style="margin-right: 0px"><FONT size=2>Free Local Delivery (within 10mls of Solihull)</FONT></DIV></LI>
<LI><FONT size=2>Special&nbsp; Discounts for On-Trade / Volume Buyers</FONT></LI>
<LI><FONT size=2><STRONG>Valuations / Disposals / Broking Services</STRONG></FONT></LI></UL>
<BLOCKQUOTE style="margin-right: 0px" dir=ltr><FONT size=2>
<TABLE style="margin-right: 0px" border=1 cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width="75%">
<TBODY>
<TR>
<TD>
<P align=center><STRONG><SPAN style="font-family: arial; color: #ff786b; font-size: 12pt">&nbsp;BORDEAUX 2012 - PLEASE CONTACT US FOR LATEST OFFERS / RECOMMENDATIONS.</SPAN></STRONG></P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></FONT></BLOCKQUOTE></TD>
<TD style="font-size: 12pt" bgColor=#add8e6 vAlign=center>
<P align=left><FONT size=1><SPAN style="font-size: 10pt"><STRONG>Visit our exciting contemporary&nbsp;store at:-</STRONG></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P align=center><FONT size=1><SPAN style="font-size: 10pt"></SPAN></FONT><FONT size=1><SPAN style="font-size: 10pt"><STRONG>35 Main Street, Dickens Heath, Shirley, Solihull, B90 1UB. </STRONG></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P align=center><FONT size=1><SPAN style="font-size: 10pt"><STRONG>T: 0121 745 6999 / 07771 978236&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </STRONG></SPAN></FONT><FONT size=1><SPAN style="font-size: 10pt"><STRONG>E: <A href="mailto:divinefinewines@btinternet.com">divinefinewines@btinternet.com</A></STRONG></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P align=center><FONT size=1><SPAN style="font-size: 10pt"><STRONG>We sell to&nbsp;Private; Trade &amp;&nbsp;Corporate Clients, both in the UK and overseas.&nbsp;Internet Sales form a substantial part of our business, but we&nbsp;are open for Walk-in Retail as follows:-</STRONG></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P align=center><FONT size=1><SPAN style="font-size: 10pt"><STRONG><SPAN style="font-size: 12pt">Tues-Fri:&nbsp;12pm-7pm; &nbsp;Sat 11am-6pm; Sun &amp; Mon: Closed</SPAN>&nbsp;</STRONG></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P align=center><FONT size=1><FONT size=2><SPAN style="font-family: arial; color: #f20808"><STRONG><U>&nbsp;STOP&nbsp;PRESS</U>:</STRONG>&nbsp;</SPAN></FONT></FONT> PLEASE NOTE THAT THE STORE IS <STRONG><SPAN style="font-family: arial; color: #f40c0c">CLOSED ON TUESDAY 10 SEP</SPAN></STRONG> DUE TO A MAJOR TRADE TASTING IN LONDON</P>
<P align=center><FONT size=1><FONT size=2><SPAN style="font-family: arial; color: #f20808"></SPAN></FONT></FONT><FONT size=1><FONT size=2><SPAN style="font-family: arial; color: #f20808"><STRONG><U>Rose Shines:</U> Our Domaine Montrose Rose&nbsp;2012 (Languedoc) was served to guests at Buckingham Palace's Coronation event in July 2013 - not bad for a £7.50 wine! Our Chateau d'Esclans Rose 2012 (Provence, £21.50) received a rave review and 18.5pts/20 from Matthew Jukes [Weekend Mail, June 2013]. &nbsp;&nbsp;</STRONG></SPAN></FONT></FONT>&nbsp; </P>
<P align=center><FONT size=1><FONT size=2><SPAN style="font-family: arial; color: #f20808"></SPAN></FONT></FONT><STRONG><SPAN style="font-family: arial; color: #f40808">Fancy&nbsp;your own tasting?</SPAN> </STRONG>We can deliver a private tasting here in our Store or at a venue of your choice.&nbsp;Ideal for getting to know fellow School mums / clients / colleagues / team building / celebrating a success or maybe a retirement.&nbsp;You will need 10+ guests. Contact us to discuss&nbsp;options,&nbsp;and we'll give you a most reasonable&nbsp;quote.&nbsp;&nbsp; </P>
<P align=center><FONT size=1><FONT size=2><SPAN style="font-family: arial; color: rgb(242,8,8); font-size: 10pt">Divine Fine Wines was established in 2003 by&nbsp;owner, Alan Harding, and we are very proud&nbsp;of our&nbsp;</SPAN></FONT></FONT><FONT size=1><FONT size=2>5 Star Rating.&nbsp;Our prices are highly competitive,&nbsp;case prices being&nbsp;among the very best in the UK.&nbsp;</FONT></FONT> <FONT size=1><FONT size=2>You will often see our wines on the tables of fine restaurants, but <STRONG>rarely in supermarkets</STRONG> or the High&nbsp;Street&nbsp;- where lower quality, commodity wines predominate.</FONT></FONT><FONT size=1><FONT size=2></FONT></FONT> </P>
<P align=left><FONT size=1><FONT size=2></FONT></FONT>&nbsp;</P>
<P align=left><FONT size=1><FONT size=2><IMG border=0 alt="" src="http://divine.e-combuilder.com/admin/companies/divine/images/pagefiles/dhstoreinternalfullshotapr2010.jpg"></FONT></FONT></P>
<P align=left><FONT size=1>. </FONT><A href="http://www.richmondandrigg.co.uk/wine.jpg" target=_top></A></P></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD>
<P align=center>&nbsp;</P>
<P align=center><IMG border=0 alt="" src="http://divine.e-combuilder.com/admin/companies/divine/images/pagefiles/chmusarbottleimage.jpg" width=61 height=226></P>
<P align=center><FONT size=+0><FONT size=2><STRONG>World Class</STRONG> <STRONG>Wines</STRONG> incl Fine&nbsp;Claret &amp; Rhone; all the top Champagnes; a full range of Chateau Musar vintages;&nbsp;Catena; Greywacke; Spy Valley; Palliser; Ridge;&nbsp;Beaucastel; St Hallett; d'Arenberg;&nbsp;Mitolo; Au Bon Climat; Allegrini; Chapoutier; Chateau de St Cosme&nbsp;etc</FONT></FONT></P></TD>
